---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: The Lab
description: Eight interactive demos from Webpage Anatomy, each on its own page. Check color contrast, play with the box model, resize a breakpoint simulator, and more.
permalink: /lab/
---

<header class="panel hero" style="text-align:left; padding-block: var(--space-8) var(--space-6);">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Interactive lab</p>
    <h1 style="font-size: var(--step-h2);">The Lab</h1>
    <p class="panel__lede">These are the interactive demos from Webpage Anatomy. Each one has its own page here, so you can open, bookmark, or share exactly the one you need.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="panel">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Every demo, on its own page</p>
    <h2>All Eight Demos</h2>
    <div class="panel__body card-grid" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
      {% for demo in labDemos %}
      <a class="lab-trigger" href="/lab/{{ demo.slug }}/">
        <span class="sticker {{ demo.color }}">
          <span class="lab-trigger__text">
            <h3>{{ demo.title }}</h3>
            <p>{{ demo.description }}</p>
          </span>
          <span class="mono lab-trigger__open"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1" y="1" width="14" height="14" rx="2.5"></rect><line x1="1" y1="5.5" x2="15" y2="5.5"></line><circle cx="3.3" cy="3.2" r="0.7" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></circle></svg>Open</span>
        </span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top: 2rem;"><a href="/">← Back to Webpage Anatomy</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
